      "inputText": "I received a call today about an offer on my book. I am not saying much because nothing is signed or official and I'm definitely not trying to jinx it.\n\nI've been pacing around my kitchen acting as if my dishwasher completely understood what was going on, but I just needed to vent somehow so this was the way to do it. In the meantime, my agent is handling all the steps and hopefully I'll have the details soon so I can let everyone including family, co-workers and the group chat know.\n\nAfter writing five books, this one was the hardest as I almost gave up trying twice. The first two were useful in terms of learning about gravity, the third was close to that idea and patience was learned from the fourth.\n\nThere's still a lot of things to do such as paperwork, more edits and the waiting game ahead. Tonight, I'm just going to be happy because it all finally happened - it actually happened.\n",
